The product: Reactor Predictive Maintenance (PdM)
Predictive-maintenance analytics for reactor-adjacent rotating equipment in r=
egulated environments.

Our match review points to Reactor Predictive Maintenance (PdM) as the strong=
est overlap with your focus: Nuclear reactor predictive maintenance fits ener=
gy deep tech; not fusion, and regulated end-use review is essential. Provisio=
nal focus fit, not investment readiness or eligibility confirmation.

Maturity: validated prototype (TRL 4-5); the first real-data pilot on a partn=
er site is the agreed next milestone, and we would value exactly this convers=
ation with you.

A professional pitch deck is attached (nuc-pdm-reactor.pptx) - it contains th=
e technical summary, the validation evidence with the exact datasets and meas=
ured results, and cited market data. If you prefer a walkthrough, we are glad=
 to give a short online presentation at your convenience.

To be transparent about our stage: we are pre-commercial, seeking pilot partn=
ers and seed-stage funding, and we deliberately present each product to a sin=
